        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 14B1 Multi-Point Trim 2 x 10 Inch American Cylinder Above Lever </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern 2 x 10 Inch American Cylinder Multi-Point Trim with 3-5/8 Inch c.c. is for use on Marvin and PGT brand patio doors with a multipoint lock mechanism already installed. This patio door handleset features an american cylinder above the lever. It will fit doors 1-5/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The Modern Multi Point Handleset with American Cylinder Above Handle is available with several finish and trim options.\r\n<p>\r\nThis multipoint trim set is intended to replace the trim from Marvin and PGT brand patio doors. The lock to lever distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm). <b>This set does NOT come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism</b> (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Multipoint-door-config-4.gif?v=1704354772\" width=\"228\" height=\"266\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek Configuation #4 Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Brass Modern Multi Point Trim with Door Configuration #4:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance Between Trim and Cylinder or Thumbturn (for Keyed, Passage, and Patio Functions): 3-5/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-3/4\" please specify.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel spindle.</li>\r\n<li>Function: Keyed Entry with Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Active (inside):</b> Active lever inside with fixed inactive lever outside. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Inactive:</b> Fixed inactive levers both sides of door. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Patio:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, One (1) interior thumb turn and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Keyed lock cylinder outside with thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, Two (2) cylinder collars, One (1) american profile cylinder with key outside & thumb turn inside and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Multi-Point Trim 2 x 10 Inch American Cylinder Above Handle",
                "description": "The Modern 2 x 10 Inch American Cylinder Multi-Point Trim with 3-5/8 Inch c.c. is for use on Marvin and PGT brand patio doors with a multipoint lock mechanism already installed. This patio door handleset features an american cylinder above the lever. It will fit doors 1-5/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The Modern Multi Point Handleset with American Cylinder Above Handle is available with several finish and trim options.",
